\\
&\hspace{2.2cm}\psi(x)\simeq\frac{C_{1}}{[2m(V(x)-E)]^{1/4}}
      \exp\!\Bigl[-\frac{1}{\hbar}\!\int^{x}\!\sqrt{2m\bigl(V(y)-E\bigr)}\,dy\Bigr] 
      +\frac{C_{2}}{[2m(V(x)-E)]^{1/4}}
      \exp\!\Bigl[+\frac{1}{\hbar}\!\int^{x}\!\sqrt{2m\bigl(V(y)-E\bigr)}\,dy\Bigr].
\\
&\;V(y)\simeq\frac{V_{0}}{a^{2}}y^{2}\;\Rightarrow\;
