&\boxed{\;
\psi(x)\;\underset{x\to\infty}{\sim}\;
\frac{C_{1}}{x^{1/2}}\exp\!\Bigl[-\frac{\sqrt{2mV_{0}}}{2\hbar a}\,x^{2}\Bigr]
\;+\;
\frac{C_{2}}{x^{1/2}}\exp\!\Bigl[+\frac{\sqrt{2mV_{0}}}{2\hbar a}\,x^{2}\Bigr]\;}
\\
&\text{Bound states require the non‑normalisable term to be absent }(C_{2}=0).\\[8pt]
&\textbf{(ii) } x\to0 .\qquad 
V(x)=V_{0}\Bigl(\frac{a}{x}-\frac{x}{a}\Bigr)^{2}
        =\frac{V_{0}a^{2}}{x^{2}}-2V_{0}+O(x^{2}) .
\\
&\hspace{2.2cm}\Longrightarrow\;
