  Hence $A_{\text{ref}}$ and $A_{\text{trans}}$ have the same sign – the reflected wave is **in phase** with the transmitted wave (no $\pi$ phase reversal).

* (Conversely, for $\eta_2>\eta_1$, $r<0$ and the reflected wave is $180^\circ$ out of phase with the transmitted wave.) 

